@page "/data-sources"

<PageTitle>Data Sources · TurboBoard</PageTitle>

<section class="page-heading" aria-labelledby="data-sources-title">
    <span class="eyebrow">Workspace</span>
    <h1 id="data-sources-title">Data Sources</h1>
    <p>Secure SQL database connections and their discovered Schema will be managed here.</p>
</section>

<section class="empty-state" aria-labelledby="data-sources-empty-title">
    <span class="empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3" />
            <path d="M4 5v7c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V5M4 12v7c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3v-7" />
        </svg>
    </span>
    <h2 id="data-sources-empty-title">No Data Sources configured</h2>
    <p>The workspace is ready. Connection management arrives in the next implementation slice.</p>
</section>
